{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o046a","title":"诏为诸葛亮立庙沔阳","accounts":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o046a-account","label":"《诸葛亮传第五》正文","text":"诏为诸葛亮立庙沔阳","evidence":["zhuge-e-o046a-q"]},{"id":"zhuge-a-p048-judgment","label":"《襄阳记》","text":"《襄阳记》载习隆、向充请近墓立庙于沔阳并约束私祭，刘禅始从。","evidence":["zhuge-q-p048-judgment"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":263,"label":"春","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"zhuge-y263","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"zhuge-q-o086","basis":"春"},"evidence":["zhuge-e-o046a-q","zhuge-q-o086","zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhuge-e-o046a-q","source_order":[35,266,"O046a"],"order":6806}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"zhuge-e-o046a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-e27e5f8f7352789295d2","layer":"original","quote":"景耀六年春，诏为亮立庙于沔阳〖33〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":265,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-3a665f982f59f4321b04","layer":"modern","quote":"〖18〗六年：景耀六年（公元 263）。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":429,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5c4c42970dd122437e5b","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o086","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9fe4ebfa42a59d8d7bb9","layer":"original","quote":"六年冬〖18〗，魏征西将军邓艾伐蜀，自阴平由景谷道旁入〖19〗。瞻督诸军至涪停住；前锋破，退还，住绵竹。艾遣书诱瞻曰：“若降者，必表为琅邪王〖20〗。”瞻怒，斩艾使。遂战，大败；临阵死，时年三十七。众皆离散，艾长驱至成都。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":409,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":111,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p048-judgment","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-9a23b750b0fd1de47c7e","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝七﹞《襄阳记》曰：“亮初亡，所在各求为立庙，朝议以礼秩不听。百姓遂因时节，私祭之于道陌上。言事者或以为‘可听立庙于成都’者，后主不从。步兵校尉习隆、中书郎向充等，共上表曰：‘臣闻周人怀召伯之德，甘棠为之不伐；越王思范蠡之功，铸金以存其像。自汉兴以来，小善小德而图形立庙者多矣；况亮德范遐迩，勋盖季世？王室之不坏，实斯人是赖；而蒸尝止于私门，庙像阙而莫立；使百姓巷祭，戎夷野祀：非所以存德念功，述追在昔者也。今若尽顺民心，则渎而无典；建之京师，又逼宗庙：此圣怀所以惟疑也。臣愚以为宜因近其墓，立之于沔阳，使所亲属以时赐祭；凡其臣故吏欲奉祠者，皆限至庙。断其私祀，以崇正礼。’于是始从之。”","attribution":"《襄阳记》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":317,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-fd5ed0527486e7859bd9","start":0,"end":294,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
